                            <comment id="17021461" author="andrew_palumbo" created="Wed, 22 Jan 2020 20:12:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;when cutting RC3, hdfs and spark modules had already been reset to use next iteration development poms&#160; &lt;tt&gt;14.2-SNAPSHOT&lt;/tt&gt; for their dependencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
 diff --git a/engine/hdfs/pom.xml b/engine/hdfs/pom.xml
 index 07cf7d5bd..3dc92a09f 100644
 &#8212; a/engine/hdfs/pom.xml
 +++ b/engine/hdfs/pom.xml
 @@ -174,13 +174,13 @@
 &amp;lt;dependency&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;groupId&amp;gt;${project.groupId}&amp;lt;/groupId&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;mahout-core_${scala.compat.version}&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;14.2-SNAPSHOT&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;
 + &amp;lt;version&amp;gt;14.1&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;/dependency&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;dependency&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;groupId&amp;gt;${project.groupId}&amp;lt;/groupId&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;mahout-core_${scala.compat.version}&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;14.2-SNAPSHOT&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;
 + &amp;lt;version&amp;gt;14.1&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;type&amp;gt;test-jar&amp;lt;/type&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;scope&amp;gt;test&amp;lt;/scope&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;/dependency&amp;gt;
 diff --git a/engine/spark/pom.xml b/engine/spark/pom.xml
 index 93d8ab2e5..765225814 100644



a/engine/spark/pom.xml
 +++ b/engine/spark/pom.xml
 @@ -252,13 +252,13 @@
 &amp;lt;dependency&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;groupId&amp;gt;org.apache.mahout&amp;lt;/groupId&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;mahout-core_${scala.compat.version}&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;14.2-SNAPSHOT&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;
 + &amp;lt;version&amp;gt;14.1&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;/dependency&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;dependency&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;groupId&amp;gt;org.apache.mahout&amp;lt;/groupId&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;artifactId&amp;gt;mahout-hdfs_${scala.compat.version}&amp;lt;/artifactId&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;version&amp;gt;14.2-SNAPSHOT&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;
 + &amp;lt;version&amp;gt;14.1&amp;lt;/version&amp;gt;
 &amp;lt;/dependency&amp;gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This was a mistake on my part due to the manual release steps being used to deploy 2.11 and 2.12 artifacts.&#160; I have notes that with some sed/awk magic could be turned to scripts eventually; we should try to automate this release process, or at least narrow it down to a couple of scripts in 14.2 IMO.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17021527" author="andrew_palumbo" created="Wed, 22 Jan 2020 21:34:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/388&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/388&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17021751" author="hudson" created="Thu, 23 Jan 2020 04:00:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;SUCCESS: Integrated in Jenkins build Mahout-Quality #3634 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/3634/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/3634/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-2083&quot; title=&quot;Release sources contain pom.XmlBackup and are mising engine and hdfs submodules&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-2083&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-2083&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;release&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; rollback release manually, reset to scals 2.11, (github: rev d28a505c61a5c8284a1b5bcc936a3188e01f530b)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) community/community-engines/pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
