	&lt;li&gt;(edit) engine/spark/pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) core/pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) engine/hdfs/pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) engine/pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) community/community-engines/h2o/pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) community/pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) engine/spark/src/main/scala/org/apache/mahout/sparkbindings/package.scala&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) community/community-engines/flink-batch/pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) engine/spark/src/main/assembly/dependency-reduced.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) distribution/pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) pom.xml&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;(edit) website/docs/latest/tutorials/misc/mahout-in-zeppelin/index.md&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="17022181" author="andrew_palumbo" created="Thu, 23 Jan 2020 15:12:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;also (finished) working on this in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/389&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/389&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17022245" author="hudson" created="Thu, 23 Jan 2020 16:20:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;SUCCESS: Integrated in Jenkins build Mahout-Quality #3635 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/3635/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://builds.apache.org/job/Mahout-Quality/3635/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-2084&quot; title=&quot;a default source distribution for  is being created under $MAHOUT_HOME/target&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-2084&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-2084&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-2083&quot; title=&quot;Release sources contain pom.XmlBackup and are mising engine and hdfs submodules&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-2083&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-2083&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: prevent build from creating a default source (github: rev 8df99c7249b99ef137fb0f2935ac0c3050215fe4)&lt;/p&gt;
